[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6095315579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115071#issuecomment-6095315579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115071","id":6095315579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa08iew","user":{"login":"hebekeg","id":32514646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTE0NjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32514646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg","html_url":"https://github.com/hebekeg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hebekeg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T07:53:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T07:53:00Z","body":"It appears that Mozc (the open-source version of Google IME, owned by Google) is designed not to display a popup when the IME layout dimensions are unknown.\n\nConsequently, the fact that the area becomes zero in this section may be preventing the conversion popup from appearing.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/232e6b14abf6e590b41d60f11704e42de22bff72/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L156-L161\n\nI added an area with a width of 1 and a height of 1, as shown in the code below, and verified it by building locally.\n```cpp\ncf.dwStyle = CFS_EXCLUDE;\ncf.rcArea.left = p_pos.x;\ncf.rcArea.right = p_pos.x + 1;  // Add +1\ncf.rcArea.top = p_pos.y;\ncf.rcArea.bottom = p_pos.y + 1;  // Add +1\nImmSetCandidateWindow(p_himc, &cf);\n```\n\nAs a result, the popup now appears as shown below.\n<img width=\"238\" height=\"154\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/811dc58f-5d34-4c43-947f-ae6cc51702d9\" />\n\nFor a more precise fix, I believe it would be necessary to retrieve the line height and width from the \"LineEdit\" or \"TextEdit\" components and match those values.\n\nAdditionally, during this verification, I discovered a new issue where the IME overlaps the input text when typing near the bottom edge of the screen. The image below shows a custom build, but the same issue occurs in other 4.x versions.\n| Microsoft-IME | Google IME |\n| :---: | :---: |\n|  <img width=\"520\" height=\"267\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/606aee8a-236a-47ae-a30e-799f33e2c72a\" /> | <img width=\"523\" height=\"269\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c90d130-5cdd-4b3f-af76-82b019f255ca\" />\n\nI haven't verified this in detail, but since the issue relates to the display position, I suspect that adjusting the size of cf.rcArea might resolve it.\n\nUnfortunately, I am not well-versed in C++ and do not know the specific method for obtaining the width and height. Therefore, I am limiting myself to this comment.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6095315579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6111587539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115071#issuecomment-6111587539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115071","id":6111587539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbEds0w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_u